    {
      "id": "u_e86de00f4bbeba41afab9e15_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "As a replacement to __TRILIUM_PH_0__Note context aware widget__TRILIUM_PH_1__, Preact exposes the current note context in the __TRILIUM_PH_2__ hook:",
      "sourceHash": "e86de00f4bbeba41afab9e151520cc6d68f61786c06395611649390d030326fd",
      "context": "Hooks > Custom hooks > useNoteContext",
      "contextHash": "5a37df875bab0a6c4e0276cc3a9ed3d66adc8127469645c5dd92ec77aaeab24c",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_f00923578c996fc1c04e3609_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Note that the custom widget must be inside the content area (so note detail widget) for this to work properly, especially when dealing with splits.",
      "sourceHash": "f00923578c996fc1c04e360914bf0a3f5da066461c330cb2e1229efdef7b1261",
      "context": "Hooks > Custom hooks > useNoteContext",
      "contextHash": "5a37df875bab0a6c4e0276cc3a9ed3d66adc8127469645c5dd92ec77aaeab24c",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_7cb12c20be8caa19e78c7e6d_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__ is an alternative to __TRILIUM_PH_1__ which works even if the widget is not within the note detail section and it automatically switches the note context as the user is navigating around between tabs and splits.",
      "sourceHash": "7cb12c20be8caa19e78c7e6daa999b1637361ad9da714a875190497bff285d08",
      "context": "Hooks > Custom hooks > useActiveNoteContext",
